 "comments": [
  {
   "body": "arguably these were more correct than the suggested file names mentioned (`configuration.nix` is now contending for NixOS entrypoint with both `system.nix` as well as with flakes), but yeah, unfortunately `_class` may have been mostly confusing to newer users. perhaps we could find a better place for them some time.",
   "created_at": "2026-06-18T10:10:32Z",
   "id": 4740867951,
   "minimized": null,
   "reactions": {
    "+1": 0,
    "-1": 0,
    "confused": 0,
    "eyes": 0,
    "heart": 0,
    "hooray": 0,
    "laugh": 0,
